  "description": "A stream-first, mount-based virtual filesystem for .NET. Mount local disk, in-memory, and custom backends under a single path tree, with cross-cutting concerns (auth, auditing, path rewriting, symlink following) composed through an ordered middleware pipeline. Ships with built-in in-memory and local-filesystem providers; cloud backends (S3, Azure) are available as separate add-on packages.",
